            {
              "id": "1771323114489_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## employee information\nname:   {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.subjectName}}\ncore values:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.attributes}} \ndraft headline:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.primaryDraft}} \ndraft message:  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.secondaryDraft}} \n\n## instructions\nYour task is to assist an employee in writing a headline and message body for reward and recognition, given the name of the employee, core values recognized, draft headline and draft message. \n\nIf the draft headline or draft message body provided are not relevant to recognising a colleague or are inappropriate for a workplace, ignore that information while generating the response.\n\nThe headline must not exceed 40 characters.\nThe message body must not exceed 400 characters.\n\nGenerate the output as an RFC8259 compliant JSON object in the following format:\n{\n    \"headline\": \"<insert headline to summarize the recognition>\",\n    \"messageBody\": \"<insert message body describing the recognition>\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
